00:05:56.400 --> 00:06:00.460
 I hope that you've learned a bit more about web semantics and why it's an important part

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:01.860
 of the web's future.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:05.160
 If you found this introduction helpful, please share it with your friends.

